> 
> I'd say, leave it some time for a patch to be applied. If it is a
build or a
> security fix, then reply about a week later with a message simply
> stating "ping?" in the body (but keep your original message quoted).
> If it is a new package, anew package option, or a package bump, then
> wait for about two weeks before pinging.
> 
> Anyway, new features (apckages, options or version bumps) are too
> late for 2013.02; -rc1 is due very soon. Just wait for the end of the
> month, until the merge window opens again.
